IMPORT `cen-duties`

-- Census Act 1973, ss 7(2), 8, 10, 11, 13, 14, 17, 18, 19, 20, 21, 22, 23 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_census-act-1973.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

